  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Sostenible de Acre II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Acre Sustainable Development Program (PDSA-II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos son poner en prctica un programa de inversiones que: (i) apoya el establecimiento de plantaciones forestales comerciales en tierras degradadas, (ii) apoya la creacin e implementacin del sistema estatal de concesin forestales, y (iii) apoya el fortalecimiento institucional del gobierno para mejorar la administracin forestal y la prestacin eficiente y eficaz de servicios de gestin forestal para el setor privado.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives are to implement an investment program that: (i) supports the establishment of commercial forest plantations on degraded lands; (ii) supports the creation and implementation of the state forest concession system; and (iii) supports the institutional strengthening of the government to improve forest administration and the efficient and effective provision of forest management services.</narrative>
  </description>
